<title>USA: Edison supplying coal to National Steel.</title>
<headline>Edison supplying coal to National Steel.</headline>
<dateline>DETROIT 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Edison Energy Services, a subsidiary of DTE Energy Co, is now supplying pulverized coal to the first of three blast furnaces at National Steel Corp's Great Lakes Division.</p>
<p>Edison said it plans to supply coal for the second furnace by later this week and for the third in February.</p>
<p>Edison is supplying the coal under a 15-year contract signed last year. The contract was valued at more than $200 million.</p>
<p>((--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
